    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "He shows a star shoot Gu to Lang Ya land spirit and asks for reverse refinement. The land spirit calls the Gu tampered, hard to recreate without at least a refinement grandmaster, and a new Gu that needs research costs. Fang Yuan then holds over five thousand star shoot Gu and treats the Gu as necessary for spring star rain after one successful use.",
        "chapters": [
          671
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "reverse-refine-attempts",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later he fails to reverse engineer the recipe with wisdom Gu’s help, calls star shoot Gu Star Lord Wan Xiang’s self-created Gu worm, and judges that reverse refining needs star path master attainment because the Gu was tampered with.",
        "chapters": [
          711
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "reverse-refine-attempts",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wisdom_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Still later, after he obtains star shoot Immortal Gu, the text states that the mortal star shoot Gu Star Lord Wan Xiang sold were refined by using star shoot Immortal Gu, and that this top-down method is why reverse deduction was hard.",
        "chapters": [
          852
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "reverse-refine-attempts",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
